<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 575.65, down 3.68.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 288 to 236.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,488,755, compared with 11,663,010 Monday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
